OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform Wales leader Dan Thomas
OL,4,Afaces no further police action after
OL,5,Aassault arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police investigation into Reform's
OL,8,Fformer leader in Wales has been
OL,9,Fdropped, two months after he was
OL,10,Farrested on suspicion of assault and
OL,11,Fcontrolling or coercive behaviour.
OL,13,FThomas said he had been "vindicated" by
OL,14,FGwent Police's decision that he should
OL,15,Fface no further action.
OL,17,FThe arrest had led the Member of Senedd
OL,18,F(MS) for Casnewydd Islwyn to resign
OL,19,Ffrom his role leading the largest
OL,20,FSenedd opposition group, triggering a
OL,21,Fleadership contest and the election of
OL,22,FHelen Jenner as his replacement.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
