OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform Wales leader Dan Thomas
OL,4,Afaces no further police action after
OL,5,Aassault arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FNigel Farage said he was "very pleased
OL,8,Fthat Dan Thomas has been cleared",
OL,9,Fadding he had "stood by him throughout
OL,10,Fthis process".
